        <mxCell id="9cBsJs4_Wq6cjwBRVgjx-2" value="&lt;h1&gt;Android Connection&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;To facilitate the connection between an emulator and the client application - we need a way to stream the screen from the device at low latency (this applies to both the emulator and a physical device).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Requirements are streaming the video from the device to the client and publishing touchscreen commands at specific locations to actuate the piano tiles game.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=5;spacingTop=-20;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
